 *                                    150, it may crash the browser.
 * @param  {Integer} [detailY]        number of segments,
 *                                    the more segments the smoother geometry
 *                                    default is 16. Avoid detail number above
 *                                    150, it may crash the browser.
 * @chainable
 * @example
 * <div>
 * <code>
 * // draw an ellipsoid
